ident occurred near Kebemer off the coast of northwestern Senegal. Authorities on El Hierro in the Canary Islands have declared an emergency after a marked increase in migrant boat arrivals.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Egypt train crash leaves several dead, over 100 injured</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:592b7477cc13ddcf00614371dcc54008f2514561d623ed71f62bedda99243b21</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T16:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/egypt-train-crash-leaves-several-dead-over-100-injured/a-79892916--0936ecd1e565.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/egypt-train-crash-leaves-several-dead-over-100-injured/a-79892916?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A train derailed after colliding with another train south of Cairo, with authorities confirming several deaths and saying more than 100 passengers were injured. Over 50 ambulances were deployed to the scene.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ebola: Why is there still no vaccine?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9c03b828ba4f5418d59d2708b1d7acda9259560bad3b2510db364e2623033c2f</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T21:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ebola-why-is-there-still-no-vaccine/a-79888134--134cc892a91f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ebola-why-is-there-still-no-vaccine/a-79888134?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ebola has been known about for decades, but there is still no vaccine against the Bundibugyo strain of the virus causing the current outbreak. New research raises hopes of protection against the various types of Ebola.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
